// The clause after "cannot be tested on the build host (...):", from how the
// function reaches what cannot run there.

ut_because_at(string via_s, string what_s) {
  string ret_s = "it reaches " + what_s;
  if(via_s == "*") {
    ret_s = "it is " + what_s;
  } else if(via_s != "") {
    ret_s = "it calls '" + via_s + "', which reaches " + what_s;
  }
} return string ret_s;
("*", "asm 'in8'"):("it is asm 'in8'")
("g", "asm 'in8'"):("it calls 'g', which reaches asm 'in8'")
("", "asm 'in8'"):("it reaches asm 'in8'")

// A function short of two cases that cannot be tested on the build host is not
// short: it needs none, and a note says why rather than the minimum being
// lifted silently. One that has a case anyway already has an error at that case
// (../cases/untestable.id), so it gets nothing more here.
// `given` may now be repeated (docs/TESTS.md), so the "not exempt" branch
// (ut_at(s1_of_v) < 0, the ordinary report_cases path) is cased below by
// composing notes_base, which runs ut_mark (../mark/), with edge_fixture
// (back/drive/run/check/dce/emit/calls/fixture/setup.id), the only fixture
// with a real prog[i]/pfile[i]/pline[i] row this lane has -- edge_fixture's
// own env_init (through fn_fixture/case_fixture) does not touch utname, so
// notes_base's empty seed survives it. The `else if` branch stays uncased:
// it needs prog[i]'s own name to already be one utname marks, and every
// fixture that marks a name ("port_byte", "caller", via ut_seeded/
// ut_host_seeded) never gives that name a real prog[i]/pfile[i]/pline[i] row
// to go with it, so there is nothing this lane's fixtures can compose to
// reach it. ut_note below does not share this gap -- it takes `name` as its
// own argument rather than reading it off prog[i], so composing ut_seeded
// (which marks "port_byte") with edge_fixture (a real pfile[i]/pline[i] row)
// covers it directly.
cases_short(int i, int n) {
  string s1_of_v = s1_of((import prog)[i]);
  if(ut_at(s1_of_v) < 0) {
    report_cases(i, n);
  } else if(n == 0) {
    ut_note(i, s1_of_v);
  }
} return void;
given notes_base given edge_fixture (0, 0):() then calls report_cases:(0, 0) then calls ut_note:[0]
given notes_base given edge_fixture (0, 2):() then calls report_cases:(0, 2) then calls ut_note:[0]

ut_note(int i, string name) {
  string note_at = (import pfile)[i] + ":" + (import pline)[i] + ": note: ";
  string ut_why_v = ut_why(name);
  push((import utnote), note_at + "function '" + name + "' " + ut_why_v + "; it is exempt from the two-case minimum");
} return void;
given ut_host_seeded given edge_fixture (0, "port_byte"):() then utnote_len:(1)
given ut_host_seeded given edge_fixture (1, "caller"):() then utnote_len:(1)
